cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Where climate monitoring stops watching"
message: "If you use this dataset or analysis, please cite it."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  An inventory of 46 operational digital climate-monitoring systems scored on
  whether their output is coupled to any actuator, a 15-stage map of gaps in
  the emission-to-harm chain, heat exposure indicators for twelve southern
  European cities from ERA5 reanalysis 1950-2025, and twelve costed
  interventions ranked by deployment burden.
keywords:
  - climate monitoring
  - urban heat
  - heat mortality
  - climate adaptation
  - ERA5
  - southern Europe
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-10-09"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/marizombie/climate-change-data"
authors:
  - name: "Maryna Klokova"
references:
  - type: data
    title: "ERA5 hourly data on single levels"
    publisher:
      name: "Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S) Climate Data Store"
    notes: "Accessed via the Open-Meteo archive API"
  - type: database
    title: "OpenAlex"
    publisher:
      name: "OurResearch"
